'<a href="http://twitter.com/download/iphone" rel="nofollow">Twitter for iPhone</a>', 'note_tweet': {'is_expandable': True, 'note_tweet_results': {'result': {'id': 'Tm90ZVR3ZWV0OjE4ODIxMTk1NDc2Njg1ODI0MDA=', 'text': 'Ellison’s vision of AI surveillance keeping citizens ‘on their best behavior’ sounds like a dystopian nightmare: a centralized power enforcing compliance through fear and control. \n\nThis is exactly why we need to shift away from centralized governance models and embrace decentralized systems driven by DAOs, AI, and smart contracts.\n\nIn a decentralized framework, power doesn’t rest in the hands of a few tech oligarchs or government agencies. Instead, citizens collectively guide decisions through transparent, blockchain-based systems. \n\nAI can serve as a tool for public benefit: an advisor for informed decision-making, not an enforcer of obedience. Smart contracts execute laws automatically, free from manipulation or bias, ensuring fairness and accountability without the shadow of Big Brother looming overhead.\n\nCentralized AI surveillance reinforces control. Decentralized governance empowers people. The future of technology in society shouldn’t be about keeping us ‘in line’. \n\nIt should be about giving us tools to make fairer, more inclusive decisions ourselves. Ellison’s approach represents the past. Decentralized governance is the future.\n\n#Decentralize #feedbackloops #transparent #Tommavi\n#authentic #sstvi #zelena #performative', 'entity_set': {'hashtags': [{'indices': [1158, 1171], 'text': 'Decentralize'}, {'indices': [1172, 1186], 'text': 'feedbackloops'}, {'indices': [1187, 1199], 'text': 'transparent'}, {'indices': [1200, 1208], 'text': 'Tommavi'}, {'indices': [1209, 1219], 'text': 'authentic'}, {'indices': [1220, 1226], 'text': 'sstvi'}, {'indices': [1227, 1234], 'text': 'zelena'}, {'indices': [1235, 1248], 'text': 'performative'}], 'symbols': [], 'urls': [], 'user_mentions': []}}}}, 'legacy': {'bookmark_count': 0, 'bookmarked': False